# One line ending for the source tree: LF in the repository and in every
# checkout, on Windows too. Several tests match multi-line snippets in the
# source, and `core.autocrlf=true` used to rewrite the working copy to CRLF,
# which broke them (`AppShell.right-panel-row.test.mjs` had a local workaround).
# Binary assets keep their bytes untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.dmg binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
